Camera RAW metadata tooling

Usage: imageinfo [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  help      Show contextual help without opening inputs
  compat    Report finite legacy invocation translations
  version   Show version and current implementation scope
  session   Run bounded read-only JSONL sessions
  metadata  Inspect camera RAW metadata
  binary    List or extract stored R5 previews
  preview   Describe read-only metadata intents
  sidecar   Inspect explicit RAW/sidecar associations

Options:
      --help             Show help for this command
      --version          Show version after validating arguments
      --output <output>  Result format (help always uses plain text) [possible values: text, json]
      --color <color>    Presentation preference; foundation output is plain text [possible values: auto, always, never]
      --no-interactive   Keep this invocation noninteractive
      --interactive      Request guided mode (not implemented yet)

Reads a declared Canon EOS R5 full RAW metadata/preview subset, describes a read-only date intent, and associates explicit existing RAW/sidecar paths. Other cameras, variants, XMP content operations and metadata writes are not supported yet.
